<title>ISRAEL: Tadiran Tel wins 36 mln shekel contract.</title>
<headline>Tadiran Tel wins 36 mln shekel contract.</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>TNN Network Ltd, a unit of Tadiran Telecommunications Ltd, has won a 36 million shekel contract from Bezeq Israel Telecom to build and maintain a communications network.</p>
<p>The projected network, which will be used for internal communications between Bezeq offices and installations, will incorporate frame-relay and ATM technology. Tadiran said the network would take several years to complete.</p>
<p>($1 = 3.27 shekels)</p>
<p>- Jerusalem newsroom, 972-2-537-0502</p>
